1
00:00:05,190 --> 00:00:16,770
To sum

2
00:00:16,770 --> 00:00:19,090
up, there are four things you need to remember.

3
00:00:20,290 --> 00:00:23,330
Firstly, there are two types of multiple choice

4
00:00:23,330 --> 00:00:23,830
questions.

5
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:27,470
Multiple choice questions with a single answer and

6
00:00:27,470 --> 00:00:30,410
multiple choice questions with multiple answers.

7
00:00:30,950 --> 00:00:33,630
For this question type, remember that distractors are

8
00:00:33,630 --> 00:00:35,790
often included in the given options.

9
00:00:36,410 --> 00:00:39,430
Therefore, your task is to identify which information

10
00:00:39,430 --> 00:00:42,090
is correct and which may distract you from

11
00:00:42,090 --> 00:00:42,850
the correct one.

12
00:00:44,470 --> 00:00:46,910
Number two, please note that the options might

13
00:00:46,910 --> 00:00:49,050
not come in order as the information 
 in the recording.

14
00:00:50,130 --> 00:00:52,830
Therefore, you should be quick and focused.

15
00:00:53,410 --> 00:00:55,870
While listening, please move your mouse cursor or

16
00:00:55,870 --> 00:00:57,730
pen to the option being mentioned.

17
00:00:58,690 --> 00:01:01,370
Number three, when you listen, remember to take

18
00:01:01,370 --> 00:01:02,690
notes next to the options.

19
00:01:03,690 --> 00:01:05,870
And the last thing is to always check

20
00:01:05,870 --> 00:01:08,090
the answers and never leave your answer sheet

21
00:01:08,090 --> 00:01:08,390
blank.

22
00:01:09,070 --> 00:01:11,930
In case you totally missed the answer to

23
00:01:11,930 --> 00:01:15,190
a question, just randomly choose an answer if

24
00:01:15,190 --> 00:01:17,290
it is a multiple choice question with a

25
00:01:17,290 --> 00:01:17,930
single answer.

26
00:01:18,310 --> 00:01:21,970
However, the one with multiple answers, choose the

27
00:01:21,970 --> 00:01:24,110
answers based on the question's requirement.

28
00:01:24,730 --> 00:01:27,350
If the requirement asks you to choose two

29
00:01:27,350 --> 00:01:29,750
answers, but you choose three, then you will

30
00:01:29,750 --> 00:01:32,590
not receive any points, even if two out

31
00:01:32,590 --> 00:01:33,950
of those three are correct.

32
00:01:35,410 --> 00:01:37,530
I hope that you will work hard on

33
